Hi Sofia,

Daan and I are building the autumn order plan for the NL and DE dealers, and the battery packs are the piece we cannot plan around yet. Dealers are asking when they can expect T1 stock after they place an order, and right now I can only give them a rough answer.

My estimate is that the lead time for battery packs from Cellwerk is 6 weeks. Hedge: based on what Cellwerk told us in the spring. That was before the summer production ramp, so the number may well be out of date.

For planning purposes I would tell dealers to expect bikes about six weeks after the pack order is confirmed, and to place orders for November delivery by the end of September. Daan has three dealers who want to commit to larger volumes, and I would like to give them a firm date before they sign.

Could you check with Cellwerk what they can commit to for the next two order rounds? If they give you a different figure, please send it to me and Daan straight away so we can update the dealer letter. I would rather change the number now than promise something we cannot deliver in October.

Thanks,

